sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Service A
    participant B as Service B
    
    A->>B: Sync Request
    B-->>A: Sync Response
    
    A->>+B: Async Request
    Note right of B: Processing...
    B-->>-A: Async Response
    
    A--xB: Failed Request
    B-)A: Fire and Forget
    
    A--)B: Async Message
    
    Note over A,B: Different arrow types demonstrate various communication patterns
